The following Plume source incorporates logic/CSS adapted from Caprine:
  - Sources/Plume/InjectedScript.swift
      • codeCSS   — code-block styling (Tomorrow / Tomorrow-Night palette)
      • baseCSS   — the inset-thumb / hover-track scrollbar
      • __plumeConv (jumpTo / next / prev / nextUnread / find) — conversation
        keyboard navigation, adapted from Caprine's browser navigation logic

